# Response headers for the static app (the SPA shell, its assets, and the
# service worker), for a host that reads a `_headers` file (Cloudflare's static
# assets, Netlify). https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/headers/
#
# The policy (docs/ARCHITECTURE.md §9), checked by tests/csp.test.ts:
# - script-src 'self' only. zod would probe for `new Function` at startup and
#   report a violation even though it catches the refusal, so src/jitless.ts
#   turns the probe off before any schema is built. Nothing may be added to
#   script-src: once sync arrives this shell holds a credential in IndexedDB,
#   and script the policy lets run could read it.
# - style-src 'unsafe-inline': React sets element styles (the practice card's
#   position over the keyboard). Neither can run script.
# - connect-src: this origin (the API) and the hosts of the storage providers
#   the browser syncs with directly (docs/ARCHITECTURE.md §10). From skysa-notes:
#   Dropbox: *.dropboxapi.com (api. for metadata, content. for bytes).
#   OneDrive: graph.microsoft.com for everything but file bytes, which come
#   from the item's pre-authenticated download URL on another host —
#   *.files.1drv.com or my.microsoftpersonalcontent.com for personal accounts,
#   *.sharepoint.com for work and school ones.
#   Google Drive: www.googleapis.com, the one host the adapter asks, file
#   bytes and uploads included. Don't add *.googleusercontent.com ahead of a
#   live check that needs it: it takes in Apps Script web apps.
# Strict-Transport-Security: two years, for this host alone. `includeSubDomains`
# and `preload` are deliberately absent: each is a commitment on behalf of
# whoever hosts this, and theirs to make.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://*.dropboxapi.com https://graph.microsoft.com https://*.files.1drv.com https://my.microsoftpersonalcontent.com https://*.sharepoint.com https://www.googleapis.com; worker-src 'self'; manifest-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
